UP031 [*] Use format specifiers instead of percent format
 --> UP031_nested_parentheses.py:2:5
  |
1 | x = 1
2 | y = (("%s")) % x
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
help: Replace with format specifiers
  |
1 | x = 1
  - y = (("%s")) % x
2 + y = (("{}")).format(x)
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

